 "デスクトップ": "سَطْح الْمَكْتَب (The main graphical user interface of an operating system, usually displaying ico)  [desktop] / [desktop computer]\nمثال: デスクトップがグチャグチャになってきた。\n→ My desktop has gotten cluttered. / سَطْح الْمَكْتَب (The main graphical user interface of an operating system, usually displaying ico)  [desktop (primary display screen on a personal computer)]\nمثال: デスクトップの壁紙を犬の写真にした。\n→ I used a photo of my dog for my desktop wallpaper.",
 "デスクリプション": "وَصْف, تَوْصِيف (A sketch or account of anything in words; a portraiture or representation in lan)  [description]",
 "デスティネーション": "وِجْهَة, وُجْهَة (The place set for the end of a journey or to which something is sent; place or p)  [destination]",
 "デストロイヤー": "مُدَمِّر (That which destroys something.)  [destroyer]",
 "デスパレート": "يَائِس, قَانِط (Being filled with, or in a state of, despair; hopeless.) / مَيْئُوس مِنْهُ (Beyond hope, leaving little reason for hope; causing despair; extremely perilous)  [desperate]",
 "デスペル": "بَدَّدَ, أَزَالَ (To remove (fears, doubts, objections etc.) by proving them unjustified.)  [dispel (esp. magic or potion used to return one's character to normal status in an RPG, etc.)]",
 "デスペレート": "يَائِس, قَانِط (Being filled with, or in a state of, despair; hopeless.) / مَيْئُوس مِنْهُ (Beyond hope, leaving little reason for hope; causing despair; extremely perilous)  [desperate]",
 "デスポット": "طَاغٍ, الطَاغِي (A ruler with absolute power; a tyrant.)  [despot]",
 "デスポティズム": "اِسْتِبْدَاد, ظُلْم (Government by a despot or despots: rule by a singular authority, either a single)  [despotism]"
}
